Tabs: 1. Overview — all project fields, editable; RAG with the rule that caused it written in words. 2. Milestones — timeline of Submissions (planned vs actual) and the list under it; add, edit, and a “Mark submitted” button that sets ActualDate = today. 3. Effort — EffortLog rows by month; cumulative curve against BudgetMM; add row. 4. Notes — newest first; add note. No edit or delete. 5. History — ChangeLog rows for this project, newest first.
5.2 Remaining dashboard panels
Panel	Content
Slippage	Submissions whose PlannedDate moved later in the last 8 weeks (from ChangeLog): project, type, original date, current date, weeks slipped
