5.3 Weekly pack export
A button that generates a PDF (and PPTX if practical) inside the app — no Power BI, no Power Automate. Contents in order: KPI cards, What changed, Next 14 days, Overdue, Blocked, Slippage, Effort, Load. Header with week range and generation time. Respects the week selector.
